  "h": "Gam · 감 · Water",
  "p": "Gam is water: it keeps flowing and finds its way past every obstacle. The form adds the roundhouse kick, high outer block, twisted knife-hand block, low spread block and palm block, and finishes by stepping backwards."
 },
